            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Even More Gestures 0.2.9

- The footer is now the single, clickable gesture status indicator.
- It shows when gestures are active, paused with a live countdown, awaiting Accessibility, or need a trackpad reconnect.
- Clicking a status opens the relevant System Settings or General panel; reconnecting also restarts gesture input.
]]></description>
